Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.18,0:02:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Olin-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"A Grudge Over Red-bean Soup!\NLuffy Gets into a Desperate Situation!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sniff, sniff...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Olin-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.31,0:03:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Olin is as strong as she was\Nwhen she was Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a strong old lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not just an old lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...an Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No... way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't scream so pathetically...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not gonna get taken down...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...by that crappy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't give you any red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make a cracker out of you and eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.38,0:05:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get squashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...a battle between a beast and a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have the head of the Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:06:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The red-bean soup is all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red... bean... soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.14,0:06:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit lying around, you damn lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop, you old bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you know who I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:06:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red... bean... soup!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.85,0:07:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get down, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Udon is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Udon's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness. They're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't need your pity.\NWe're not that helpless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}! Stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He passed out...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe that a man with a 1.3-billion-berry bounty\Ngot knocked out in just two hits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can smell red-bean soup more strongly now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She beat the formidable Queen so easily...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's on another level...\NThat's how strong the Emperor of the Sea Big Mom is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Report to Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Never-Opening Cell's been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I believe it was chained up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not being able to escape,\Nit must've died inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,EXECUTIVE TOWER IN THE EXCAVATION LABOR CAMP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger! I'll report to Onigashima right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I smell red-bean soup this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Babanuki-{\i1}san{\i0}! Can we open fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Don't agitate her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}'s order?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chief Warden! The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...the smails aren't able to get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,None of us can reach Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello! This is Building B...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? The Smail isn't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because of the turmoil outside,\Nsecurity is so poor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Caribou is quite helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The enemies are in close contact,\N"They went that way" or "They're over here."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That communication uplink is a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.25,0:12:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, here is the important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Land of Wano's Smart Snails\Nhave one disadvantage. They have weak signals!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,SMART SNAIL (SMAIL FOR SHORT)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,BOSS SNAIL
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To compensate, every Smail's outgoing signal...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is first sent to what's called a Boss Snail\Nthat's set up in every region,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and it relays the signal to the receiving Smails.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand how the system works, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! You're so thickheaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I gobble up the Boss Snail in Udon...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of Udon will lose signal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't been captured this long for nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Incidentally,\NI happen to know where the Boss Snail is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So trust me to cut their communications!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why don't you go steal all the keys,\NRaizo-{\i0}chan{\i1}?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me, Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will get you out at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:14:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is the red-bean soup?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.06,0:14:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red... bean... soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How sweet and rich the smell is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And there is so much of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.87,0:14:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was worth coming all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Babanuki-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have an urgent update!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? I'm busy now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That pot is actually empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Empty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:15:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What'll happen when Big Mom who is obsessed with food\Nfinds out that there is no red-bean soup?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who will she be mad at?!\NShe may kill us all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, evacuate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Save yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't how bad it'll be,\Nbut this is gonna be a disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! Who in the world ate it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So she really wanted to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand why she's sad\Nbecause I wanna eat it again, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The red-bean soup was so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--So...\N--So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...who ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why's everyone looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you just said...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that you ate the soup out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did I say that out loud?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The red-bean soup was so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just said it silently to myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.95,0:16:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You do realize you just said it again, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffytaro-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I finally found Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But as usual, you're in the center of trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...eat all of the red-bean soup?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You smell like red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was close...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot that if we step out of the ring,\Nwe'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't forgive you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm begging you! Wait, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Again, the name Big Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you who ate the soup! Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know who I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah! I'm disguised as a samurai now,\Nso she doesn't recognize me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Making Big Mom angry over food brings disaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she's lost her senses\Nand slipped into a Hunger Pang attack now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,no one can stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is bad! Really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:18:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It rang again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're in trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we get pushed once more, we'll be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't yield even an inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If that pot was filled with red-bean soup,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I could have shared it with everyone from that town!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.53,0:19:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That town?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She means Okobore Town?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is sweet red-bean soup.\NGo ahead, Olin-{\i1}san{\i0}, try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! It smells good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone in that poor town was so kind to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I wanted to bring back a lot of red-bean soup to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That delicious red-bean soup...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted them to have it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh... Sh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not having a Hunger Pang attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's her kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's rampaging because of her kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you eat it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.53,0:20:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.07,0:20:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! I won't let him die!\NI'm not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come off!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come off!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! The collars!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.67,0:21:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The collars came off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man! What did I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:22:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--It came off!\N--{\i1}I can't believe it... That was...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Alright! Let's run, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before you forget that feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A moment of crisis will reveal your true power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Practice now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.18,0:22:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I fail, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ryuo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.91,0:22:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:23:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring it on! Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The enraged Big Mom is on a rampage!\NShe fights furiously against Luffy whose back is to the wall!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}As the labor camp is about to be destroyed,\NLuffy's enemy Queen plans a strategy to capture Big Mom!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.20,0:23:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What will happen to Luffy?!\NAnd how will the deadly operation end up?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Stop the Emperor of the Sea! Queen's Secret Plan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.75,0:23:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
